    "message": "chore(deps)!: remediate tooling advisories\n\nRefresh eligible dependencies, scope modern glob and minimatch upgrades,\nand backport deepmerge prototype poisoning protection. Keep exact\nsecurity quarantine exceptions and reject unmitigated audit findings.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: development requires Node.js 24 or newer and the pinned\npnpm 12 toolchain. Published plugin Node.js and ESLint support is unchanged.",
